* A sum or difference of external names with a dot in them (Blk.Start+bsize, Blk.Start-Blk.End):
* a link-time expression like those without a dot, the note naming them with the dot (as
* rof2elf does from a ROF); names with a dot were left out, as had two undefined symbols to add
* ("invalid operands").
* fixed: ef4030d 2026-10-14 r68togas: link-time expressions of names with a dot
* expect text: 00000000 203c00000000 4e71
* expect reloc: r68x_b41c413a+0x00000400
* expect reloc: r68x_f5123f5e
 psect ext_sum_dot,0,0,0,0,0
 dc.l Blk.Start+bsize+1024
 move.l #Blk.Start-Blk.End,d0
 ends
